  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Abu Dhabi&#x2019;s Cap and Trade Scheme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Abu Dhabi has prepared a program that aims to reduce GHG emissions through different initiatives and is undertaking the feasibility of a Cap &amp; Trade scheme which aims to study the practicality of setting up a regulatory framework to establish such a scheme. GGGI will support the Environment Agency of Abu Dhabi (EAD) with expert advice and knowledge sharing on this topic.</narrative>
  </description>
